# Frontend env
# Vanilla static (public/): no build-time env. Set the backend at runtime via any of:
#   1. <script>window.__BACKEND_URL__="https://YOUR-BACKEND.onrender.com"</script> before config.js, or
#   2. ?backend=https://YOUR-BACKEND.onrender.com (saved to localStorage), or
#   3. localStorage.setItem('swaraj.backend','https://YOUR-BACKEND.onrender.com')
# Leave empty for monolith (same origin).
#
# Next.js app (frontend/app): build-time env:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=https://YOUR-BACKEND.onrender.com
